  "title": "Testing Data Overlap Between SFT and GRPO on Autoformalization",
  "summary": "SFT followed by GRPO is the standard post-training recipe for reasoning models. You collect labeled data, fine-tune, then run reinforcement learning with a reward signal. But there's a design decision that's unexplored: how much of your GRPO data should overlap with your SFT data?",
